  "summary_en": "Japan Digital Agency's brand guidelines for the \"Government AI Gennai\" generative AI environment, separating copyright licensing from trademark/brand use. It sets permitted name and logo uses by user type (ministries, municipalities, corporations, individuals, third parties), derivative naming, and required disclaimers to prevent confusion with government endorsement.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Copyright licence for code is separated from permission to use name and logo.",
   "Descriptive references are allowed without prior permission if no endorsement is implied.",
   "Derivatives must carry their own names and may not use the official logo.",
   "Use of the official name requires the operator's name alongside it.",
   "Mandatory disclaimer notices for derivatives, integrations and public services; Digital Agency contact point handles queries and misuse."
  ],
